---
// Bodoni Moda posters: a fashion cover, a ballet bill, the optical-size pair.
---
<figure class="pw-p" id="bodoni-moda-cover" data-name="Cover">
  <div class="pw-art bm-a">
    <p class="bm-a__m">MODA</p>
    <p class="bm-a__l bm-a__l--1">The new<br /><em>minimalism</em></p>
    <p class="bm-a__l bm-a__l--2">Paris · Milan<br /><em>Tokyo</em></p>
    <p class="bm-a__big"><em>Contrast</em></p>
    <p class="bm-a__f"><span>Spring issue</span><span>No. 96</span></p>
  </div>
</figure>
<figure class="pw-p" id="bodoni-moda-pas-de-deux" data-name="Pas de deux">
  <div class="pw-art bm-b">
    <span class="bm-b__amp" aria-hidden="true">&amp;</span>
    <p class="bm-b__t">Pas</p><p class="bm-b__d">de</p><p class="bm-b__t2">deux</p>
    <p class="bm-b__f">An evening of ballet · Opening night</p>
  </div>
</figure>
<figure class="pw-p" id="bodoni-moda-six-and-ninety-six" data-name="Six and ninety-six">
  <div class="pw-art bm-c">
    <div class="bm-c__row"><p style="font-variation-settings:'opsz' 6, 'wght' 400">Hairline</p><span>opsz 6</span></div>
    <div class="bm-c__row"><p style="font-variation-settings:'opsz' 96, 'wght' 400">Hairline</p><span>opsz 96</span></div>
    <p class="bm-c__b">The same word at the same size. Optical size 6 thickens every hairline for small print; 96 sharpens them to a thread for the headline.</p>
  </div>
</figure>
<style>
  .bm-a { background: #f5f1ea; color: #0c0c0c; font-family: 'Bodoni Moda Variable', serif; }
  .bm-a__m { position: absolute; left: 0; right: 0; top: 2cqi; text-align: center; font-size: 31cqi; line-height: 1; letter-spacing: -0.03em; font-variation-settings: 'opsz' 96, 'wght' 500; }
  .bm-a__l { position: absolute; font-size: 5cqi; line-height: 1.05; font-variation-settings: 'opsz' 24, 'wght' 600; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.04em; }
  .bm-a__l em { font-style: italic; text-transform: none; letter-spacing: 0; color: #b0162a; font-variation-settings: 'opsz' 24, 'wght' 400; }
  .bm-a__l--1 { left: 6cqi; top: 52cqi; } .bm-a__l--2 { right: 6cqi; top: 70cqi; text-align: right; }
  .bm-a__big { position: absolute; left: 0; right: 0; bottom: 9cqi; text-align: center; font-size: 22cqi; line-height: 1; font-variation-settings: 'opsz' 96, 'wght' 400; }
  .bm-a__big em { font-style: italic; }
  .bm-a__f { position: absolute; left: 6cqi; right: 6cqi; bottom: 4cqi; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; font-size: 2.6cqi; letter-spacing: 0.2em; text-transform: uppercase; font-variation-settings: 'opsz' 10, 'wght' 500; }
  .bm-b { background: #b0162a; color: #f5f1ea; font-family: 'Bodoni Moda Variable', serif; padding: 8cqi; }
  .bm-b__amp { position: absolute; right: -6cqi; bottom: -14cqi; font-size: 120cqi; line-height: 1; font-style: italic; font-variation-settings: 'opsz' 96, 'wght' 400; color: #8a0e1f; }
  .bm-b__t, .bm-b__t2 { position: relative; font-size: 34cqi; line-height: 0.85; letter-spacing: -0.03em; font-variation-settings: 'opsz' 96, 'wght' 900; }
  .bm-b__d { position: relative; font-size: 15cqi; line-height: 1; font-style: italic; margin-left: 30cqi; font-variation-settings: 'opsz' 96, 'wght' 400; }
  .bm-b__t2 { text-align: right; }
  .bm-b__f { position: absolute; left: 8cqi; bottom: 7cqi; font-size: 2.8cqi; letter-spacing: 0.18em; text-transform: uppercase; font-variation-settings: 'opsz' 10, 'wght' 500; }
  .bm-c { background: #0c0c0c; color: #f5f1ea; font-family: 'Bodoni Moda Variable', serif; padding: 10cqi 7cqi; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6cqi; }
  .bm-c__row { border-top: 0.3cqi solid #f5f1ea44; padding-top: 3cqi; }
  .bm-c__row p { font-size: 21cqi; line-height: 1; letter-spacing: -0.02em; }
  .bm-c__row span { font-family: var(--font-mono, monospace); font-size: 2.6cqi; letter-spacing: 0.15em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #d9b36a; }
  .bm-c__b { margin-top: auto; font-size: 4.2cqi; line-height: 1.4; font-style: italic; font-variation-settings: 'opsz' 18, 'wght' 400; color: #f5f1eacc; }
</style>
